# Code style

Names carry the meaning. Do not add comments. If a block needs a comment, rename or split. License headers stay. Do not comment or reformat `third_party/`.

Split files that grow past 100 lines when the new file has a real name. Generated tables, catalog rows, and vendored cores are exempt.

If the same logic appears three times, it wants one function.
